msgstr "आपकी खरीद"

msgid "Subtotal"
msgstr "उप-योग"

msgid "Discount"
msgstr "छूट"

msgid "Tax (included)"
msgstr "कर (शामिल)"

msgid "Tax"
msgstr "कर"

msgid "Total paid"
msgstr "कुल भुगतान"

msgid "your purchase"
msgstr "आपकी खरीद"

msgid ""
"It goes back the way you paid; your bank may take a few days to show it."
msgstr ""
"यह उसी तरीके से वापस किया जाता है जिससे आपने भुगतान किया था; आपके बैंक में "
"इसे दिखने में कुछ दिन लग सकते हैं।"

msgid "We have paid it back to you directly."
msgstr "हमने इसे सीधे आपको वापस कर दिया है।"

msgid "It is kept as credit on your account for your next purchase."
msgstr ""
"इसे आपकी अगली खरीद के लिए आपके खाते में क्रेडिट के रूप में रखा जाता है।"

msgid "Your refund for order %(number)s"
msgstr "ऑर्डर %(number)s के लिए आपकी धनवापसी"

#. Translators: %(amount)s is money with its currency; %(how)s is a sentence
#. on how it is paid back.
msgid "We are refunding %(amount)s for order %(number)s. %(how)s"
msgstr "हम ऑर्डर %(number)s के लिए %(amount)s की धनवापसी कर रहे हैं। %(how)s"

msgid "your course"
msgstr "आपका पाठ्यक्रम"

#. Translators: %(learner)s is a person's name; %(title)s a course or program.
msgid "%(learner)s bought %(title)s"
msgstr "%(learner)s ने %(title)s खरीदा"

